{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12205080","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12205080","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1220508001:1":{"text":"큰일이야… 저 분노한 돼지가 다른 새끼 돼지들을 다 쫓아냈어!","source_cn":"完蛋了……那只发怒的猪把其它小猪都吓跑了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF50C2375B79172A0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1220508002:1":{"text":"치피, 진정해! 돼지들이 마을 방향으로 도망간 것 같아.","source_cn":"先别紧张！看它们跑的方向，像是回村里去了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA4C9159B024B8CDB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1220508003:1":{"text":"치피, 저 돼지를 제압할 방법이 있어?","source_cn":"满满，你有办法制服这只大猪吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7729F981028A8876","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1220508004:1":{"text":"에? 치피는 동물 길들이는 방법을 모른다구!","source_cn":"哎——？！可满满不会驯兽啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x61C654BA495936F5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1220508005:1":{"text":"아니면 마을로 돌아가서 돼지 주인에게 뭔가 해결책이 있는지 물어볼까?","source_cn":"要不然，我们先回去问问它的主人有没有驯服的办法？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x35424503A9BB06D1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1220508006:1":{"text":"그럴 수밖에… 그럼 치피가 여기서 저 돼지를 감시하고 있을 테니, 해미 너는 얼른 <style=\"highlight\">스몰워터 마을</style>로 돌아가서 방법을 찾아봐!","source_cn":"好像只能这样了……那满满留下来保护这只猪，免得它跑丢！...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1FA3741DD79300C3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":7,"localized_text_count":6,"speaker_count":2}}